{"speciesId":305,"names":{"fr":"Galegon","es":"Lairon","en":"Lairon","ja":"コドラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LAIRON tempers its steel body by drinking highly nutritious mineral springwater until it is bloated. This POKéMON makes its nest close to springs of delicious water."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LAIRON feeds on iron contained in rocks and water. It makes its nest on mountains where iron ore is buried. As a result, the POKéMON often clashes with humans mining the iron ore."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"When two LAIRON meet in the wild, they fight for territory by bashing into each other with their steel bodies. The sound of their collision carries for miles."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se nourrit du minerai de fer qu’il fore. Il défend son territoire en chargeant avec son corps d’acier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se nourrit du minerai de fer qu’il fore. Il défend son territoire en chargeant avec son corps d’acier."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Lairon fight over territory, and when their steel bodies collide, sparks fly."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Lairon fight over territory, and when their steel bodies collide, sparks fly."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il raffole du minerai de fer. Il défend son territoire en chargeant avec son corps d’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Le encanta comer hierro. Lucha por su territorio embistiendo a sus rivales con su cuerpo de acero."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鉄鉱石が 大好物。 鋼の 体を ぶつけ合って 縄張り 争いを する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pour montrer sa force à ses ennemis, Galegon frotte son corps d’acier contre les rochers pour produire de gigantesques étincelles."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Para alardear de su fuerza, hace saltar chispas frotando contra grandes rocas el cuerpo de acero que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鋼の よろいを 岩に ぶつけた ときに 出る 火花の 大きさで 強さを アピールする 習性。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Galegon adoucit son corps d’acier en buvant une eau minérale jusqu’à ce qu’il soit tout boursouflé. Ce Pokémon fait son nid près des sources d’eau minérale riches en nutriments."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lairon templa su cuerpo de acero bebiendo agua mineral muy rica en nutrientes hasta que no puede más. Este Pokémon suele crear su nido cerca de manantiales de rica agua."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lairon tempers its steel body by drinking highly nutritious mineral springwater until it is bloated. This Pokémon makes its nest close to springs of delicious water."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"栄養 満点の わき水を お腹いっぱい 飲む ことで 鋼の 体が 鍛えられる。 美味しい わき水の 近くに 巣を つくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Galegon se nourrit du fer contenu dans les rochers et dans l’eau. Il fait son nid sur les montagnes renfermant du minerai de fer. Du coup, il se confronte souvent aux humains travaillant dans les mines."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lairon se alimenta del hierro que hay en las rocas y el agua. Hace su nido en las montañas, de donde se saca el hierro. Por eso, se encuentra muchas veces con las personas que están trabajando en las minas extrayéndolo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lairon feeds on iron contained in rocks and water. It makes its nest on mountains where iron ore is buried. As a result, the Pokémon often clashes with humans mining the iron ore."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"石や 水に 含まれている 鉄分を 食べる。 鉄鉱石の 埋もれた 山に 巣を つくるが 鉄を 取りに来る 人間と 争いになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Vivre au sein de montagnes riches en minerai et abondantes en eau de source lui a souvent valu d’entrer en conflit avec l’Homme."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Habita en zonas ricas en hierro y con numerosos manantiales, por lo que en el pasado las disputas territoriales con los humanos eran frecuentes."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Lairon live in mountains brimming with spring water and iron ore, so these Pokémon often came into conflict with humans in the past."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"コドラが 暮らす 山は 湧き水と 鉄鉱石が 豊富なので 人と 争いに なることも 多かった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Galegon se disputent les territoires en luttant au corps à corps, comme le montrent les éraflures sur leur armure d’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Resuelven sus disputas territoriales embistiendo y golpeando con el cuerpo. En sus corazas de acero se pueden apreciar hendiduras y rasguños."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"During territorial disputes, Lairon fight by slamming into each other. Close inspection of their steel armor reveals scratches and dents."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体を ぶつけ合って 縄張りを 争う。 鋼の 鎧は よく 見ると 傷や へこみが あるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":305,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",10],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",10],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",10],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",11],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",11],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",11],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",11],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",10],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",16],[23,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",25],[6,"level-up",25],[7,"level-up",25],[8,"level-up",25],[9,"level-u